19JUN2024 @hanoihantrakul
These experiments were conducted by Hanoi Hantrakul in 
JUN2024 to explore how perceptual and supervised pitch 
signals could encode better melodic and pitch information
in the ConvUMM models. The intention was to give these models
to Yiqing Lu and have him use these models for the SVS task.
This is because better melody encoding will be more apparent
with the SVS task compared to full mix vocal music generation.